From 4b92ff54fec1f8eb1902f5cc431e8c88793fda0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:21:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Merge branch 'mega' into integration

- mod_lab.c: the Mega option becomes the last entry of the one evolve list
  ("To Mega <name>", modLabMegaTarget unchanged); the entries of a species
  the disc lacks are skipped as dcb-import does.
- tickConditions: one Ultimate branch: Machinedramon (48 h), then
  getChampionEvolutionTarget after 96 h, a Mega target only from
  MEGA_EVOLUTION_HOURS (120 h).
- The effect-origin commit (538a4c0 / 8434651) is the same change: merged
  clean.

